    "text": "Stoke Moran manor, 3 a.m. You are the first officer on the scene.\n\nJulia Stoner lies dead in the corridor outside her bedroom. Her sister Helen found her. Her stepfather, Dr. Roylott, stands nearby. Her bedroom was locked from the inside. No wound on her.\n\nFind out what killed her, who was behind it, and how." },
